<h3>Autocompletar do jQueryUI</h3>
<p>Código-fonte:</p>
<pre>
&lt;input type="text" class="form-control" id="popname" value="" placeholder="Autocompletar populações..."&gt;
&lt;script type="text/javascript"&gt;
    jQuery('#popname').autocomplete({
        source: '/ajax/stock/population_autocomplete',
    });
&lt;/script&gt;
</pre>

<p>Resultado:</p>
<input type="text" class="form-control" id="popname" value="" placeholder="Autocompletar populações...">
<script type="text/javascript">
  jQuery('#popname').autocomplete({
    source: '/ajax/stock/population_autocomplete',
  });
</script>

